## 6. Implementation Checklist

| # | Change | File | LOC | Priority |
|:-:|:---|:---|:---:|:---:|
| 1 | R-B21 severity → error | `pipeline-gates.json` | 1 | P0 |
| 2 | R-B24 exclude_patterns | `pipeline-gates.json` + `gate-runner.js` | ~15 | P1 |
| 3 | R-B22 pattern expand | `pipeline-gates.json` + `SKILL.md` | ~5 | P1 |
| 4 | BA tag strip | `enrich-indexer.js` | 1 | P0 |
| 5 | Hard gates | `validate-enrichment.sh` | ~3 | P0 |
| | **Total** | **4 files** | **~25** | |

**Execution order:** P0 first (1 → 4 → 5), then P1 (2 → 3)

---

## 7. Decision Log

| Decision | Rationale |
|:---|:---|
| ❌ Reject spec-doctor.js | Anti-pattern: Patch Layer, permanent band-aid, semantic loss |
| ❌ Reject state injection | Same anti-pattern embedded differently; generic filler ≠ quality |
| ❌ Reject warning budget | Conflicting with hard gates; over-engineering for current scale |
| ❌ Reject SKILL.md seeding | Text ≠ enforcement (BP-026) |
| ✅ Promote emoji → error | Clear format violation, agent self-corrects |
| ✅ Tighten R-B24 | Reduce false positive, don't force; nav buttons ≠ CTA buttons |
| ✅ Expand R-B22 pattern | Preserve semantic params, standardize format |
| ✅ BA strip in enricher | 1 line, correct boundary, existing I/O point |
| ✅ Hard gates validate | Defense-in-depth, catch edge cases |
| ✅ Keep R-B25/26 as warning | Reasoning issues → advisory, not enforcement |

---

## 8. Relation to Existing Gates

```
                    ┌─────────────────────────────────┐
                    │  Pipeline Quality Gate Topology  │
                    └─────────────────────────────────┘

Pipe 1 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Gate A (Index)     → error-only    → ba-indexer output
  Gate B Tier 1      → error+warning → raw specs (format)
    R-B21 emoji        ← CHANGE: warning → error
    R-B22 nav refs     ← CHANGE: expand pattern
    R-B24 button       ← CHANGE: tighten (exclude_patterns)
    R-B25/26           ← KEEP: warning (advisory)
  Gate B Tier 2      → agent semantic → raw specs (meaning)
  Gate C             → error-only    → proposed screens

Gap Discovery ──────────────────────────────────────────────
  (No format gates — inherits Gate B via R-C6)

Pipe 2 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  enrich-indexer.js  → BA tag strip   ← CHANGE: add strip
  validate-enrichment → error+warning → enriched specs
    CHECK 5 emoji      ← CHANGE: warn → fail
    CHECK 5 BA tags    ← CHANGE: warn → fail

Bridge Spec ────────────────────────────────────────────────
  validate-specs.js  → error+warning → JSON specs (new, session trước)
    G2 emoji           ← error (đã implement)
```
